{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport secrets,json\nnames=['Wee Wobble','We Be Still','Wee Lean','Wobble Fit','Wee Bit Wobbly','Wee Repose','Wiiishful Balance','Wobble Together','Wee Centre','Wee Poise','Fit to Wobble','Wee Equilibrium','Wee Unsteady','Wee Retreat','Wee Balance','Wee Sway','Wee Breathe','Wee Composed','Wee Calm','Wee Tipping Point','Wee Still Here','Wee Plumb','Wee Lean In','Wee On Board','Wee Pebble','Wee Rest','Wee Serene','Wee Well','Wee In Balance','Wee Upright','Wee Mat Matters','Wee Steady','Wee Not Moving','Wee Stretch','Wee Tilt','Wee Hold It','Wee Grounded','Wee Nice Posture','Wee Stand By','Wee Little Lean','Wee Soft Landing','Wee Mind the Wobble','Wee Daily Balance','Wee Almost Still','Wee Stillness','Wee Away','Wee At Ease','Wee Quiet Feet','Wee Good Form','Wee Keep Centre']\n# Exclude source word from the selected in-game title while retaining exactly 50 candidates.\nnames[6]='Wishful Balance'\ni=secrets.randbelow(len(names)); title=names[i]; slug=title.replace(' ','-')+'-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261104-224022'\nPath('PROGRESS.md').write_text(f'''# Build progress\\\\n\\\\n## Task and deliverables\\\\n- Build PLAN.md in full on the read-only my-3dge workspace.\\\\n- Title chosen using Python secrets.randbelow from 50 candidates: **{title}** (index {i}).\\\\n- Development folder: \"'`{slug}/`.'\"\\\\n- Final single-file game: \"'`{slug}.html` in this root.'\"\\\\n- Also deliver root \"'`exit-interview.json`, reports, and documented one-command tests.'\"\\\\n\\\\n## Current state\\\\n- Read TASK.md and PLAN.md sections 1–4; continuing full plan reading.\\\\n- No code yet. Need fetch engine at plan-tested e7a1243 and hub client/documentation.\\\\n- Shared machine: use file URLs or own ephemeral loopback server; only stop own processes. No subagents.\\\\n- Toolkit cheatsheet path is absent; viewport-matrix and Python Playwright are installed.\\\\n\\\\n## Decisions\\\\n- Keep engine unchanged; implement gameplay and art under labs/game.\\\\n- Include all essential activities, five-day story, finale, local group, AI Hub ghosts, attract, settings/dev/about.\\\\n\\\\n## Test issue tally\\\\n- Issues caught: 0. Critical: 0.\\\\n''')\nPath('title-selection.json').write_text(json.dumps({'title':title,'index':i,'candidates':names,'slug':slug},indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nprint(title); print(slug)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport secrets,json\nnames=['Wee Wobble','We Be Still','Wee Lean','Wobble Fit','Wee Bit Wobbly','Wee Repose','Wiiishful Balance','Wobble Together','Wee Centre','Wee Poise','Fit to Wobble','Wee Equilibrium','Wee Unsteady','Wee Retreat','Wee Balance','Wee Sway','Wee Breathe','Wee Composed','Wee Calm','Wee Tipping Point','Wee Still Here','Wee Plumb','Wee Lean In','Wee On Board','Wee Pebble','Wee Rest','Wee Serene','Wee Well','Wee In Balance','Wee Upright','Wee Mat Matters','Wee Steady','Wee Not Moving','Wee Stretch','Wee Tilt','Wee Hold It','Wee Grounded','Wee Nice Posture','Wee Stand By','Wee Little Lean','Wee Soft Landing','Wee Mind the Wobble','Wee Daily Balance','Wee Almost Still','Wee Stillness','Wee Away','Wee At Ease','Wee Quiet Feet','Wee Good Form','Wee Keep Centre']\n# Exclude source word from the selected in-game title while retaining exactly 50 candidates.\nnames[6]='Wishful Balance'\ni=secrets.randbelow(len(names)); title=names[i]; slug=title.replace(' ','-')+'-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261104-224022'\nPath('PROGRESS.md').write_text(f'''# Build progress\\\\n\\\\n## Task and deliverables\\\\n- Build PLAN.md in full on the read-only my-3dge workspace.\\\\n- Title chosen using Python secrets.randbelow from 50 candidates: **{title}** (index {i}).\\\\n- Development folder: \"'`{slug}/`.'\"\\\\n- Final single-file game: \"'`{slug}.html` in this root.'\"\\\\n- Also deliver root \"'`exit-interview.json`, reports, and documented one-command tests.'\"\\\\n\\\\n## Current state\\\\n- Read TASK.md and PLAN.md sections 1–4; continuing full plan reading.\\\\n- No code yet. Need fetch engine at plan-tested e7a1243 and hub client/documentation.\\\\n- Shared machine: use file URLs or own ephemeral loopback server; only stop own processes. No subagents.\\\\n- Toolkit cheatsheet path is absent; viewport-matrix and Python Playwright are installed.\\\\n\\\\n## Decisions\\\\n- Keep engine unchanged; implement gameplay and art under labs/game.\\\\n- Include all essential activities, five-day story, finale, local group, AI Hub ghosts, attract, settings/dev/about.\\\\n\\\\n## Test issue tally\\\\n- Issues caught: 0. Critical: 0.\\\\n''')\nPath('title-selection.json').write_text(json.dumps({'title':title,'index':i,'candidates':names,'slug':slug},indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nprint(title); print(slug)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"Wobble Fit\nWobble-Fit-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261104-224022\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
