{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_52","type":"agent_message","text":"The activities now have separate rules: rhythm stepping, alternating-foot slacklining, buoy steering, marble physics, direct-control reps, and the five-stage storm finale. The island and pose animation code are also in place. Next I’m building the controller-first shell, then I’ll check integration, scoring, and progression headlessly.\n"}}
