{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_80","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('labs/game/looks/retreat.ts');p.write_text(p.read_text().replace(\\\", map: { texture: 'texture:sand', seed: 4 }, normalScale: .1\\\", ''))\nPY\nnpx tsc -b tsconfig.check.json --pretty false\nnode labs/game/tools/onefile.mjs\npython3 labs/game/tools/boot.py\"","aggregated_output":"Built /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261104-224022__x54facc/work/Wobble-Fit-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261104-224022.html\n{\n  \"errors\": [\n    \"[CORE_BAD_SPEC] actionMap \\\"actionMap:menuRetreat\\\": move names \\\"forward\\\", which actions lacks; move names \\\"back\\\", which actions lacks; move names \\\"left\\\", which actions lacks; move names \\\"right\\\", which actions lacks: give each field a value of its type inside its range and values, every required field, and no key the schema lacks (node x describe <kind> lists the fields)\",\n    \"Page.wait_for_function: Timeout 90000ms exceeded.\"\n  ],\n  \"state\": {\n    \"game\": null,\n    \"ready\": false,\n    \"errors\": [],\n    \"msg\": \"The retreat could not open. Uncaught EngineError: [CORE_BAD_SPEC] actionMap \\\"actionMap:menuRetreat\\\": move names \\\"forward\\\", which actions lacks; move names \\\"back\\\", which actions lacks; move names \\\"left\\\", which actions lacks; move names \\\"right\\\", which actions lacks: give each field a value of its type inside its range and values, every required field, and no key the schema lacks (node x describe <kind> lists the fields)\"\n  }\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_81","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > labs/game/ui/lines/cast.ts <<'EOF'\n/** @file Two hundred short retreat remarks. Daily cast dialogue is data, not a cutscene script. */\nexport const CAST_LINES:Record<string,string[]> = {\nTare:[\n'Welcome to Little Fulcrum. I measure only wobble.',\n'Please keep to the centre. No reason.',\n'Your mat is ready. It has been ready for some time.',\n'Have you been leaning toward anything lately? A decision, perhaps.',\n'You may take your time. I have taken the liberty of recording it.',\n'That is your best arrival so far.',\n'The ferry has left. It was very pleased with itself.',\n'Please stand naturally. An interesting interpretation.',\n'There is no wrong way to begin. There are several unusual ways.',\n'A pebble is a small achievement with excellent posture.',\n'You came back. A lot of people say they will.',\n'The plaques have not moved. We have moved the lawn.',\n'How did you sleep? This is not on the form.',\n'I have prepared a fresh centre for you.',\n'You are less wobbly than the sign. The sign has been spoken to.',\n'Your cairn is growing. This is usually how cairns work.',\n'Did you enjoy yesterday? You can enjoy it differently today.',\n'The east lawn is particularly restful. Please rest there.',\n'A circle has no preferred side. We are working on it.',\n'I have noticed your progress. I was going to notice something.',\n'The drinks are sliding. A feature of the drink.',\n'Please do not compare your wobble to the sea.',\n'The paddleboard is quite confident. Perhaps too confident.',\n'Your left foot has arrived. We will wait for the other.',\n'We have asked the turtle to use the crossing.',\n'The rope has been checked. It is still a rope.',\n'You have left the line. The line is fine.',\n'Your splash has been entered in the guest book.',\n'You may breathe out. I am not sure why I whispered that.',\n'Everything is approximately where we left it.',\n'The island sits on one rock. I have not mentioned it.',\n'We do not mention it to guests. You are a guest.',\n'I am very calm. My needle is simply interested.',\n'Please remain east of your previous position.',\n'Gerald knows. Gerald has always known.',\n'If anyone asks, everything was always fine.',\n'The rock is doing its best. So are you.',\n'There is a very small amount of weather on the way.',\n'That sound was the island relaxing.',\n'I have never been responsible for this many deckchairs.',\n'Calm is now mandatory. Thank you for cooperating.',\n'Please bring the guests east. They enjoy company.',\n'Nan is already there. Nan is always already there.',\n'The centre stone says do not. This is a special occasion.',\n'Everything is balanced now. Please do not tell anyone about the rock.',\n'You held the island. The island has made a note of it.',\n'I have never seen Plumb open their eyes.',\n'The last check is mostly for me. I would like a nice number.',\n'You may stay as long as you like. The ferry does not return.',\n'It is a lovely morning to begin again.',\n],\nPlumb:[\n'Good. Now do that again, as though you meant it.',\n'Breathe in. Breathe out. There is a useful order to these things.',\n'Your centre is where you left it. Find it again.',\n'And rest. Thank you for considering stillness.',\n'We will call that a start.',\n'The mat forgives you. The mat has no other appointments.',\n'Your knee is where it should be. I mention it because it is rare.',\n'Do less. That is a complete instruction.',\n'The imaginary chair has excellent support.',\n'One foot is sufficient. The other may observe.',\n'Four more. I may be lying.',\n'That was adequate. I chose that word carefully.',\n'An unnecessary movement. We have kept it for reference.',\n'You are an archer. There is no target to disappoint.',\n'Fold neatly. The gull values a flat surface.',\n'The comma is a pause. You are taking it literally.',\n'Please keep breathing. It is among your better habits.',\n'A bridge does not ask for applause.',\n'The pose is yours. I am merely standing near it.',\n'Serenity can be practised. Apparently.',\n'The water is not a mat. It is very insistent about this.',\n'The next step is the next step.',\n'The rhythm will continue without your agreement.',\n'Keep the hoops aloft. Dignity is optional.',\n'The gull has given you a four. It gives everyone a four.',\n'Enter the water with a clear intention.',\n'You have returned to vertical. We missed it.',\n'Follow Gerald. Do not attempt to understand Gerald.',\n'The slope is a teaching aid.',\n'Good weather is no substitute for composure.',\n'The island is now six degrees out of true.',\n'Please remain calm. Calm is mandatory.',\n'The plait is moving. This is unusual.',\n'Again, please. There is rather more at stake this time.',\n'Hold through the next wave.',\n'You are now a useful counterpoint.',\n'The centre is still the centre. Even now.',\n'And rest. The island may join you.',\n'Hm.',\n'Tomorrow is an excellent time for another attempt.',\n],\nGerald:[\n'Morning.', 'Morning.', 'Morning.', 'Morning.', 'Morning.',\n'Morning.', 'Morning.', 'Morning.', 'Morning.', 'Morning.',\n'Morning.', 'Morning.', 'Morning.', 'Morning.', 'Morning.',\n'I have been coming here for thirty years.',\n'The east side used to be the west side. Long story.',\n'That rock has always looked tired.',\n'I finished before breakfast. I had breakfast yesterday.',\n'Nice weather for it.',\n'I knew you would manage.',\n'Nan taught me. Nan taught the rock.',\n'Keep going. I will be here already.',\n'A good morning. I would know.',\n'Morning again.',\n],\nBex:[\n'My mum says this is good for me.',\n'This is a stone. I am waiting for a message.',\n'I got a ninety-eight. I was not trying.',\n'The sea has better reception.',\n'I have already found the centre. It was in the middle.',\n'The chair is invisible. Finally, some decent furniture.',\n'They moved my mat. I did not move with it.',\n'The frog has more followers than me.',\n'I was breathing before it was an activity.',\n'I think Plumb blinked. It might have been the weather.',\n'The paddleboard is fine. It is everyone else who is tilting.',\n'The gull is judging me. We have that in common.',\n'I would clap, but that would be an input.',\n'The turtle is taking its time. A professional.',\n'Your splash was pretty good. For a splash.',\n'I knew about the rock. The stone told me.',\n'The weather is updating. Very slowly.',\n'Everything is going downhill. Including the noticeboard.',\n'I am remaining calm ironically.',\n'Gerald said a whole sentence. Write it down.',\n'This is a surprisingly demanding holiday.',\n'I am going east. It has better stability.',\n'You saved my stone. It appreciates it.',\n'Fine. That was quite impressive.',\n'Can we stay another day? Do not tell my mum I asked.',\n],\nNan:[\n'I have been standing here since Tuesday.',\n'Which Tuesday? Yes.',\n'The frog remembers me. I owe it a favour.',\n'You are doing very well at arriving.',\n'I like a place that knows where its middle is.',\n'The chair and I have an understanding.',\n'Plumb was shorter when I got here.',\n'I do not count the breaths. They keep coming.',\n'A little lean now saves a larger lean later.',\n'The mat is warm. I was here first.',\n'I have crossed that line in worse weather.',\n'The turtle is an old friend. It is always late.',\n'I prefer the shallow end of the sky.',\n'The gull remembers my name. I have forgotten its score.',\n'Nice work. Do less next time.',\n'The rock and I go back a long way.',\n'I told them to use two rocks. Nobody asked.',\n'I have moved east already. You may take your time.',\n'Gerald is getting rather talkative.',\n'This is not the first storm. It is quite a polite one.',\n'There you are. I was expecting you.',\n'The island has settled. It always liked you.',\n'A Wobble Age of nineteen. I was better yesterday.',\n'I will be here tomorrow. I may already be there.',\n'Another Tuesday. How useful.',\n],\n};\nexport const PLAQUES = [\n'Did you know? This plaque was four centimetres to the left on Tuesday.',\n'Did you know? Gulls do not have a Wobble Age. They have been asked.',\n'Did you know? The sea has never been asked to stand still.',\n'Did you know? A flamingo stands on one leg because it is being watched.',\n'Did you know? The centre is nearer than you think. Unless you are at the edge.',\n'Notice: Guests are reminded to distribute themselves evenly.',\n'Notice: The east lawn is fully booked. Please enjoy the east lawn.',\n'Notice: If your drink slides, that is a feature of the drink.',\n'Notice: Please do not encourage the marbles.',\n'Did you know? The frog is qualified. It has not said in what.',\n'Did you know? Rest is easier when someone else is counting.',\n'Notice: Do not. Further details are not available.',\n];\nexport const EVENING = [\n'Today you wobbled less than you might have. Goodnight.',\n'The mat will remember you. It is very good at shapes.',\n'The sea will be here in the morning. We have checked.',\n'The island sits on one rock. Sleep towards the east, if convenient.',\n'Everything is level. A good place to leave things.',\n];\nexport const dialogue = (speaker:string, day:number, index:number) => {\n const list=CAST_LINES[speaker]??CAST_LINES.Tare;\n const span=speaker==='Tare'?10:speaker==='Plumb'?8:5;\n return list[Math.min(list.length-1,(Math.min(5,day)-1)*span+index%span)];\n};\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
