{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_147","type":"agent_message","text":"The Hub check exposed an important failure: the protocol could finish while the 3D scene was still loading. I’ve reduced warm-up to the render paths this game uses. The scene now becomes ready, and the stronger check caught a second issue: ghost updates passed an array where scene actions require an object. That bridge is fixed; I’m rerunning it before calling multiplayer complete.\n"}}
