mat.'}</p></div>`,\n    },\n  );\n  a.ui.back = () => a.show(a.flow?.mode === 'front' ? 'title' : 'pause');\n}\nexport function group(a: ScreenApp): void {\n  a.ui.menu(\n    'group',\n    'A class, not a match',\n    'Room for four.',\n    'Connect up to four controllers. Every connected pad gets a mat. Keyboard and mouse join with Space. Other guests will gladly fill in.',\n    [\n      {\n        id: 'begin',\n        label: 'Begin Group Class',\n        detail: 'Still Ring · a moving class · Still Pond',\n        action: () => a.start('group'),\n      },\n      {\n        id: 'cpu',\n        label: 'Invite CPU guests',\n        value: a.options.cpu ? 'Yes, please' : 'Quiet mats',\n        action: () => {\n          a.options.cpu = !a.options.cpu;\n      (\n        {\n          accept: 'Enter',\n          back: 'Esc',\n          plan: 'Tab',\n          hop: 'Space',\n          lean: 'WASD',\n          left: 'Q',\n          right: 'E',\n          pause: 'Esc',\n        } as Record<string, string>\n      )[action] ?? action;\n  return `<span data-glyph=\"${action}\" class=\"glyph${device === 'pad' ? ' pad-glyph' : ''}\">${text}</span>`;\n}\nexport const safe = (text: unknown): string =>\n  String(text).replaceAll('&', '&amp;').replaceAll('<', '&lt;').replaceAll('>', '&gt;').replaceAll('\"', '&quot;');\nexport const LEAF =\n  '<svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M24 40V23M24 29C7 30 6 15 6 10c12 0 20 5 18 19ZM24 22C23 9 33 6 42 6c1 11-6 18-18 16Z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>';\n  show: (screen: string, page?: number) => void;\n  run: (action: string, args?: unknown) => void;\n  resume: () => void;\n  applyOptions: () => void;\n  begin: () => void;\n  start: (id: string) => void;\n  setting: (path: string) => unknown;\n};\n5:  private left = ['KeyQ', 'Space', 'MouseLeft'];\n7:  setCodes(left: readonly string[], right: readonly string[]) {\n72:      values[j + 2] = Math.max(pad.buttons[6]?.value ?? 0, pad.buttons[4]?.value ?? 0);\n83:      values[j + 2] = this.left.some(\nFAIL WebGPU page errors: [\"[SIM_NOT_DATA] entity 7's actor.intents.move is undefined; component fields hold plain data: store numbers, strings, booleans, null, arrays or plain objects (a direction as x, y, z numbers or an [x, y, z] list) and build the Vector3 or typed array inside the system that uses it; hold another entity by its id, never the object\"]\n29 viewport and visual checks passed; 1 failed\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
